index=windows earliest=-15m
```Detection: Repeated failed authentication attempts (Event ID 4625).```
```Alert: Three or more failures for the same account within 15 minutes.```
```False positives: Mistyped passwords, expired credentials, or user troubleshooting.```
```Limitation: Counts failures per host/account; does not distinguish source IPs or logon types.```
| rex field=_raw "<EventID[^>]*>(?<event_id>\d+)</EventID>"
| where event_id="4625"
| rex field=_raw "<Data[^>]*Name=.TargetUserName.[^>]*>(?<target_user>[^<]*)"
| where isnotnull(target_user) AND target_user!="-"
| stats count as failures min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen by host target_user
| where failures>=3
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)
| sort -failures
